              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wayenezitebele eziyizinkulungwane ezine zamahhashi nezezinqola, nabamahhashi abayizinkulungwane eziyishumi nambili; eyakubeka emizini yempi nasenkosini eJerusalema.",
