              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye izindaba zikaSolomoni, ezokuqala nezokugcina, angithi zilotshiwe encwadini kaNathani umprofethi nasesiprofethweni sika-Ahiya waseShilo nasemibonweni ka-Ido umboni ngoJerobowamu indodana kaNebati na?",
          "type": "text",
